      "paperId": "15d9896be3ee54a0d5951f19a580402c3c08aa3f",
      "title": "You Got to Look Right! Mapping the Aesthetics of Labor by Exploring the Research Landscape using Bibliometrics",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Shikha Mann",
